{
  "$comment": "Context cap settings UI presentation. Every value is derived from the budget.v1.json window rule (B / U / limitedBy, see windowCases) and slider ticks (capTickCases); input keys W, windowKind, maxOutput, priceLineTokens have the windowCases shape, conversationCap null means the conversation follows globalCap. pickerCases: the per-conversation cap picker (options follow / auto / unlimited / custom, slider, price-line hint). commitCases: committing the typed custom number. panelCases: the context panel cap row and window row (price line distance, long-context price multiplier). settingsCases: the global default cap row read from the raw stored value. Text keys, locales and number formatting are platform tests, not this fixture.",
  "schema": "oriveo.context-cap-presentation",
  "version": 1,
  "rules": [
    "pickerCases: selected = follow when conversationCap is null, else auto | unlimited | custom. effective = window rule with (conversationCap ?? globalCap) -> {B, limitedBy}; auto and unlimited = the same rule with that option -> {B, limitedBy}. ticks = capTickCases rule with (U, priceLineTokens).",
    "pickerCases: customStart = B of the conversation custom cap when the conversation is custom, otherwise effective.B ?? 128000. sliderIndex = index of the tick nearest to customStart; on a tie the lower tick wins. priceLineTickIndex = index of priceLineTokens in ticks, null when absent. unlimitedCrossesPriceLine = U > T (false when U or T is null).",
    "pickerCases: customHint compares customStart with T = priceLineTokens: T null -> none; customStart > T -> over; = T -> at; < T -> under with gap = T - customStart. gap is null unless under.",
    "commitCases (text, U, previous): remove White_Space (including U+00A0 and U+202F) and the separators , . ' U+2019 _ ; the rest must be a non-empty run of ASCII digits 0-9, otherwise {value: previous, adjusted: false, restored: true}. Digits are counted after dropping leading zeros; more than 10 digits reads as n = 2147483647 and is always adjusted. value = min(max(n, 32000), U ?? 2147483647), so U below 32000 yields U; adjusted = (more than 10 digits) or value != n; restored = false.",
    "panelCases: cap = conversationCap ?? globalCap through the window rule. capValue = effective B (null when the window is unknown and the cap is auto / unlimited: show the option name). limitedByModel = cap is custom and c > U; actual = B when limitedByModel, else null.",
    "panelCases: windowLine = unknown (U null) | window (no priceLineTokens) | windowPriceLine (T >= B) | aboveLine (T < B). priceLineDistance = max(T - used, 0) only for aboveLine (0 = already past the line), else null.",
    "panelCases: pricing {base, long} {prompt, completion} per million tokens. Each side tenths = round(long / base * 10); null when base <= 0 or missing, and null unless tenths > 10. multiplier = null when both sides are null or pricing is absent, else {input, output}. Equal sides use the \"both\" sentence.",
    "settingsCases: stored is the raw stored global cap, parsed with the capCases rule (an integral number such as 190000.0 is custom). selected = auto | unlimited | custom; anything that does not parse is auto. customPrefill = c when custom, else 256000."
  ],
